You feel spoiled.

	Zap it with a wand of cancellation.  That will neutralize the curse on
it without affecting anything inside.  You'll have to pick it up to bless it,
however.

	A good way to keep it from happening again is to put your bag of
holding into a sack.  Curses do not affect things held in bags (except the
aforementioned problem with the bag of holding), and it wouldn't matter at all
if the sack got cursed.  It would take you longer to get anything out of it,
but you would have the security of knowing your blessed bag of holding would
stay blessed.

